  {
    "id": 4001042050040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "（──……そんなに\r\nおかしなこと言ってんのかしら）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "（仕事なんだからちゃんとやろうっていうのは）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──冬優子",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00130",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……何？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……たとえばここで、\r\nふゆが『大丈夫じゃない』って言ったら",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたどうするの？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まずは、何が大丈夫じゃないか聞く、かな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうやったら解決するのか──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すぐには解決しない問題なら、\r\nどうやったら冬優子が少しでも楽になるのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことを考えると思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それは、仕事だからよね？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんそうだし──\r\n俺のやりたいことだから、っていうのもある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──……じゃあ仮に、あんたがふゆのこと\r\nめちゃくちゃ嫌いだとするじゃない？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……！？　お、おう……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そうだったとして、今同じようにふゆのこと見てたら\r\n『大丈夫か？』って声かける？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ……？\r\n前提が──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の担当アイドルがいて、俺はその子が嫌いで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その子がちょっと疲れて見える時に、\r\n声をかけるか、だよな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……まず、担当のことは\r\n嫌いにはならないと思うんだけど──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そういうことは聞いてないの\r\n仮に、っつってんでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……すまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……同じことをすると思うよ\r\n嫌いな相手だとしても、その子が俺の担当なら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その子が万全の状態で仕事にあたれるようにすることが\r\n俺の仕事だから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこに好き嫌いは挟んじゃいけないと思うし──\r\n俺も、挟みたくないし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……まぁ、理想どおりにできるかっていうのは\r\nまた別の話だけど！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……冬優子、何に困ってるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──……そうねぇ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆって間違ってんのかしらーって\r\n自信なくなってたとこ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ\r\nそれは、どういう──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……なんかちょっと最近、多かったのよ",
    "charAnim1": "shrug",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050200"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050210,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆが当たり前だと思ってることが、\r\n誰かにとってはそうじゃない、みたいなのが",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050220,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──それこそ、そんなの当たり前だと思うけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050230,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "真面目にやってる方がバカを見るとしたら、\r\nバカバカしいじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042050240,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……それで\r\n一瞬でもそんなことを思った自分も嫌になるの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104205/4001042050240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
